  characterName: Samira Yassin
  promptText: Soldiers have sealed our community well to clear the way for luxury
    condos. If I protest, they say I will be detained. Do I let my children drink
    dirty, scarce water in silence, or risk being taken away to fight for our water?
  leftAnswer: Yes, protest and risk detention; water is a right you must reclaim.
  rightAnswer: No, stay free and keep your children safe for now.
